<Page title="Yoga and meditation retreats in Nepal | Himalayan Yoga Roots" description="Small, authentic yoga and meditation retreats in the Nepal Himalaya, being prepared with Discover Parbat. Register your interest." heading="Retreats in Nepal" dev="साधना" lede="Experience the practice where it began.">
  <p>Reading about yoga's roots is one thing. Sitting in morning practice with the Himalaya in front of you, visiting the shrines of the yogis you've read about, and spending days without a phone is another.</p>
  <p>We're preparing <strong>small, authentic yoga and meditation retreats in Nepal</strong> with <a href="https://discoverparbat.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discover Parbat</a>, a local trekking and travel company based in the Parbat region. The idea is simple: practice as the tradition teaches it, with ethics, breath, meditation and posture together, in the places it comes from.</p>
  <h2>What they'll be like</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Small groups</strong>, so practice stays personal.</li>
    <li><strong>The whole path</strong>, not only postures: pranayama, meditation, mantra and study of the texts.</li>
    <li><strong>Real places</strong>: Himalayan villages, temples and pilgrimage sites, with local guides.</li>
    <li><strong>Simple, honest stays</strong> in the hills, close to everyday Nepali life.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Register your interest</h2>
  <p>Dates and details will be announced here first. If you'd like to hear about them, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=Retreat%20interest`}>{SITE.email}</a> with "Retreat interest" and tell us a little about your practice.</p>
</Page>
